<InstitutionalPage
  title="About Nuvellum"
  eyebrow="The publication"
  description="Nuvellum is an independent international digital publication covering world affairs, business, technology, culture, film, sport and ideas."
  intro="An independent international publication built around one promise: Beyond the headline."
